<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Transocean Offshore.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Transocean Offshore.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it trimmed its 1997 earnings estimate to $3.30 a share from $3.60 a share.</p>
<p>-- cut the 1998 earnings estimate to $5.90 a share from $6.05 a share.</p>
<p>-- reiterates buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Transocean lost 2-3/8 to 53-3/4 in afternoon trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
